                <pb facs="0235" n="203" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v10/pg203"/>

                <head>41. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>At its 230th meeting on January 5, 1955, the National Security Council discussed
                    controls on trade with the People’s Republic of China as spelled out in NSC 5429/5. For text of the memorandum of
                    discussion at this meeting, see <ref target="frus:frus1955-57v02/pg_2">volume
                        II, page 2</ref>. NSC 5429/5 is printed in
                        <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v12p1/pg_1062"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1952–1954, volume XII, Part 1, page 1062</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
